[E-PARTIAL-NONUNIFORM] Error: this recursive call to `grow` changes its type parameters
   ╭─[ reject/partial-nonuniform.sw:6:48 ]
   │
 6 │ def grow [a : Type] (x : a) : {Partial} Nat := grow [a := List a] (Cons x Nil)
   │                                                ───────────────┬──────────────  
